{"availability":"available","full":"bilibiliales/skystudio-decrypt","name":"skystudio-decrypt","description":"Sky Studio 音乐工具包，适用于加密的 TXT 乐谱文件。支持解密、预览、乐谱转换、MP3 导出、键盘可视化、ZIP 导出以及浏览器端处理。Sky Studio Music Toolkit for encrypted TXT sheet files. Supports decryption, preview, notation conversion, MP3 export, keyboard visualization, ZIP export and browser-side processing.","category":"Developer tools","language":"HTML","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-03-12T03:04:36Z","updated":"2026-08-20T10:59:58Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://bilibiliales.github.io/skystudio-decrypt/","topics":["decrypt","github-pages","mp3","music-tool","sky-studio","webapp"],"demo":"https://bilibiliales.github.io/skystudio-decrypt/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T18:00:59.631Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T18:00:59.631Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T18:00:59.631Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T03:24:33.442Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-15T18:00:59.631Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Sky Studio乐谱解密解析工具是一个纯静态单页面网页，用于处理 Sky Studio TXT 和 MusicXML 乐谱文件。它支持光遇乐谱解密、TXT 加密文件识别、在线预览、简谱转换、键盘可视化、MP3 音频导出，以及 MusicXML 节拍解析、61 键钢琴预览和脚本导出。"],"features":["Decrypt supported encrypted TXT music sheet files in the browser.","Parse .musicxml / .xml divisions, rests, chords, ties, and multiple parts for script timing.","Preview MusicXML on a C2–C7 61-key piano (36 white and 25 black keys) with normal or bright piano samples.","Export MusicXML to MP3 with the selected timbre; out-of-range pitches remain in the generated script.","Generate MusicXML script keys dynamically in ascending pitch order (A1, A2 … B1, B2 …)."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bilibiliales/skystudio-decrypt/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"774bffadb38d6085950f3306258ec08b77544afa27645bdeb10fa5f825972c71","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T03:24:33.537Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T03:24:33.537Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,